<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
   <head>
      <meta charset="UTF-8">
      <title>Insert title here</title>
      <style>
      .section-title {
        padding: 15px;
    	}
      .section-content {
        background-color: white;
        display: none; /* 내용은 기본적으로 숨김 */
        overflow: hidden;
    	}
    	
      
      </style>
      
      
      <script src="jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>      
      <script type="text/javascript"> 
      $(document).ready(function(){
    	  $(".section-title").click(function(){
    	        $(this).next(".section-content").slideToggle("fast");
    	    });
      })
      
      
      
      
      </script>
   </head>
   <body>
   	<div style="background-color: lightgray; margin: 10px auto;  padding: 10px;">
   		<div class="section-title">Section 1</div>
   		<div class="section-content">
   			<p> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vestibulum vitae
      turpis hendrerit, ornare nunc a, mollis neque. Donec cursus arcu magna, et
      lobortis libero sodales a. Mauris ac facilisis eros. Praesent sit amet
      pulvinar felis. Curabitur hendrerit mauris ut ornare venenatis. Vestibulum
      ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia
      curae; Nulla facilisi. Ut vehicula, felis nec bibendum commodo, dui tellus
      ultrices magna, non iaculis ipsum urna eget mi. Donec consequat dolor at
      urna dignissim, id tincidunt ligula viverra. Etiam semper libero vel
      congue sollicitudin</p>
   		</div>
   		<div class="section-title">Section 2</div>
   		<div class="section-content">
   			<p>두 번째 숨겨진 섹션의 내용입니다.<br>두 번째 줄입니다.</p>
   		</div>
   		<div class="section-title">Section 3</div>
   		<div class="section-content">
   			<p>세 번째 숨겨진 섹션의 내용입니다.<br>두 번째 줄입니다.</p>
   		</div>
   	</div>
   		
   </body>
</html>